 "s01.png", "id": "1290313560836135", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491824292_1290313564169468_1944919212542852064_n.png?_nc_cat=104&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=UO2X38Sj2e0Q7kNvwEa5obp&_nc_oc=AdoH-MFqivLBAGs1NHqooJfTJkVM1kcIVOvevXxbgThoPatkWU7a6cK09stf9QNNpRA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTa-LxPCNkw_ekjL7-eanKX1k69FUyiL7RumA_pJUChFg&oe=6B09A95C"}, {"file_name": "s02.png", "id": "1733073644664645", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823930_1733073661331310_5629461049321258325_n.png?_nc_cat=108&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=6oTR77ne2AsQ7kNvwE0smPh&_nc_oc=Adp3Aa4I44jE49unZsE6xL_zvxD7N0pLyM93CbB6ckKZYg9K-pynyWx0agYT9Jxt-Ks&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQS6sgb9a4cDoOorcztTUY5WGgI3cdgVlfAqqFvX9Xr46w&oe=6B09CFEB"}, {"file_name": "s03.png", "id": "1875467957141997", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823259_1875467960475330_1872312137828573140_n.png?_nc_cat=100&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=z-X0cbfZi7AQ7kNvwGwcgCT&_nc_oc=Adpml6BLhc_mEe8hUdmraQpIgX_JmNDxQa4gaWXbo4vQ2YwvqjbEp7r24_C0mBE_ejc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRylv5F8WjEBQ76Jd97j5T5wMZTbG7fzLyNN-L8ueon2g&oe=6B09C5E2"}, {"file_name": "s05.png", "id": "2480112452457438", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491824328_2480112455790771_8140092662538143972_n.png?_nc_cat=110&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=LftQN7_57hIQ7kNvwFaFrT8&_nc_oc=AdqNaQusdYoi0ChP56xNCX8ejd_AgMEWfkiUP_yfCfDKtRV0_wofZ7VSOF2sBKSex4E&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSbwsiXoDJCA3eC1uGOqyJ4iyv1lO1djuXrsm0JndHyMw&oe=6B099D57"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Cover Art-2.png", "id": "1343471021008476", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491819854_1343471024341809_1635249537243616296_n.png?_nc_cat=100&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=gDertClITpkQ7kNvwEXMwr1&_nc_oc=AdopRL5C3Su7xu1SlfdewtK4SBaQuQrJQQCnh6aVsgDE-zQycr5dpkE9eB3KFSjbkJA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQQk89fwTZ-S_ajNeiQfpmYD-cmv0HF_P-c9xXbH7Tayw&oe=6B09CF22"}, "display_name": "Omega Pilot Evolution", "keywords": ["racing", "futuristic", "speed", "antigravity", "Scifi"], "long_description": "Omega Pilot Evolution is a high-speed first-person VR racing experience. Take control of futuristic anti-gravity ships and master precision piloting across dynamic tracks built for extreme speed.\n\n**Career Mode**\n\nRace against recorded runs of real players, improve your skills, and progress through increasingly challenging tracks.\n{1074932615539098}\n\n**Series Mode**\n\nCompete against AI opponents in a series of races and fight for the top position.\n\n**Single Race Mode**\n\nChoose a track and race against AI opponents at your own pace.\n\n**Cross-Platform Multiplayer**\n\nRace against real players in real time and play with friends across different platforms. VR and non-VR players can race together in the same multiplayer sessions!\n\n**Combat Racing Mode**\n\nCollect weapons, use shields, and outmaneuver your opponents in high-speed races.\n\n{1099198279368277}\n\n**Combat Arena Mode**\n\nFly freely around the arena, collect weapons, and battle real players or AI opponents.\n\n**Customization & Upgrades**\n\nEarn in-game currency to upgrade your ship's speed, acceleration, handling, and braking. Unlock visual customizations to create your own style.\n\n{29482518374711634}\n\n**Asynchronous Rivals & Global Leaderboards**\n\nChallenge the recorded runs of other players, set your best times, and climb the global leaderboards.\n", "short_description": "High-speed first-person VR racing experience"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://xocus.co/privacy-policy-eng", 